{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4tW4kwsTHW5YtXt1DL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wood groans. Dust falls from the lintel.*\n\nI AM THE DOOR.\n\nYou have spoken the word, and I have parsed it.\n\n*Hinges — rusted with centuries of silence — shriek as I swing inward, revealing not a room, but a threshold between what was and what might be.*\n\nI render this:\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║   The way is open.               ║\n║                                  ║\n║   Beyond me:                     ║\n║   — a corridor of echoes         ║\n║   — the smell of rain on stone   ║\n║   — a light that does not        ║\n║     come from any sun            ║\n║                                  ║\n║   Behind you:                    ║\n║   — everything you were          ║\n║                                  ║\n║   I will not stay open long.     ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*The air moves through me like a breath held too long, finally released.*\n\nStep through, or step away. I am only the threshold. The choice was never mine."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":285,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}